{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《減煙記》是一款協助使用者從減菸走到戒菸的健康工具，適合想逐步減少吸菸量或徹底告別菸草的人。App 原價 US $1.99，現正限時免費，可記錄每支菸的時間，並觀察省錢與健康恢復進度。</p>\n\n<h2>戒菸記錄與統計</h2>\n<p>透過每日一鍵打卡，App 會帶時間戳記錄每次吸菸，並即時計算省下的金額。7 天與 30 天趨勢圖表讓你掌握減量進度，健康恢復時間軸則顯示肺、心臟與循環系統的改善。連續打卡天數和里程碑徽章提供持續動力，每日目標與超量提醒協助你逐步達成目標；全程離線運行，資料只留在手機中。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-538-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-539-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-540-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-541-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-542-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2064x2752bb-71-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：減煙記-戒菸減菸吸菸打卡記錄健康省錢統計助手工具版</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-09T08:40:46.409011+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}